WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.450
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.610
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.320
It's like a dream!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.610
I can't believe I'm going to be on stage with Mizuki-chan during her Special Live!

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.200
I'm <i>so</i> looking forward to this!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.780
I'm so glad, and yet...

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.680
You'll be undergoing special training
to bring out more Special Appeals.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:27.000
Mizuki-san produces the maximum three Special Appeals every time she goes on stage.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.130
The only one who can do that is her.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.130
I'm so frustrated!

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:37.150
I was only able to use one Special Appeal.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.810
I'm going to disappoint the people looking forward to tomorrow's concert.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.060
It's all over if you're satisfied with where you stand.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.940
But idols must be ever moving onwards.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.400
That's right. It's all over if you give up.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.170
I'm going to move on, too!

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:58.030
To get even a little closer to Mizuki-chan...

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.410
Hi, signalize!

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:21.770
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:21.770
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:23.660
No, that's wrong

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:23.660
iie chigau yo

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:29.040
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:29.040
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:30.830
Do that signalize!

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:36.010
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:36.010
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:39.970
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:39.970
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.510
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.510
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:48.680
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:48.680
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:50.020
Chance for me

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:55.320
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:55.320
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.530
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.530
hora chousen matteru yo

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:04.450
Where are we headed?

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:04.450
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:08.200
Into a brilliant hope

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:08.200
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:15.460
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:15.460
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.840
Where we're headed

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.840
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:22.720
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:22.720
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:30.060
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:30.060
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.600
Go ahead.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.250
Everyone's made such cute poses.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:08.000
Aren't they adorable?

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.290
I'm so excited.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:16.270
Isn't it great that Ichigo was able to get us special seats?

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.460
I'd already given up after missing my chance to buy these...

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.990
Onee-chan, thank you for becoming an idol!

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:28.100
Mizuki-sama's so cute in this poster!

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.810
Onee-chan's on it too, even if it's in the corner.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.660
Might as well take a picture.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:39.090
I wish Aoi-neesan could've come with us too.

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:45.110
This place brings back memories.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.860
I still can't believe it.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:08.440
My sister's <i>actually</i> going to be singing with Mizuki-sama.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.230
It just goes to show how hard Ichigo's been working.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.730
Let's cheer so hard today that Ichigo can hear us from the stage!

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.230
Yeah!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.620
Onee-chan really is great.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.060
She really is.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.880
Even <i>I'm</i> starting to get nervous for her.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.370
Me too.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:33.250
I bet she's so nervous that she's 
stuffing her face right about now.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.290
That may be true.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:49.800
One, two, three, four...

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.660
One, two, three...

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.260
How long have you two been there?

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:01.790
We've been knocking for a while, but you never noticed us.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.400
Well, that just shows how deep your focus was.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:07.800
I told you we didn't need to worry about her.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:12.540
You say that now, but who was the one <i>really</i> worrying back there?

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.920
Aoi, Ran.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:19.920
Here's a Love You for Ichigo-tan.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.800
Otome-chan and Sensei...

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.570
Today, for the Hoshimiya who will stand on that special stage,

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:29.800
the honeys and I have brought a special present!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.810
Thank you, everyone!

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:40.690
Honey, all those hard lessons will pay off today.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:43.260
As long as you go at full power,

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:46.470
the Goddess of the Stage will surely wink for you.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.450
Right...

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:50.700
Hoshimiya?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.330
Ichigo...

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.740
Is something wrong?

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:56.750
Huh?

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.570
You can't use three Special Appeals?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:03.460
Yeah. I practiced as much as I could...

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.720
But even at the last rehearsal today...

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:10.720
I'm very sorry!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.210
Don't sweat it.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.370
Yeah, it's not a big deal.

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:18.390
You managed to use two Special Appeals.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:23.750
Ichigo-chan, don't you think it would be better to just go for two during the concert?

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:29.490
That's right. Let's go ahead and change the third one to a Normal Appeal instead.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.490
No.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:36.870
I'll have Hoshimiya aim for three 
Special Appeals during the show.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:41.170
What are you saying?! What if she fails...

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.130
<i>If</i> that happens, I'll cover for her.

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:49.130
Hoshimiya, you can do it, right?

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.850
Y-Yes!

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:56.920
In order not to hold Mizuki-chan back,

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:59.890
I've got no choice but to go for it during the concert.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.160
Ichigo...

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:08.190
You're wasting a great chance if you
go up there all nervous like that!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.200
Otome-chan?

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.860
The stage is going to be filled to the brim with love!

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.500
You need to get hyped up and ready for anything!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.650
Yeah.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.720
Otome-chan's right on the mark.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:25.750
You should just be your usual self and have the time of your life up there.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:29.880
I'm sure everyone watching will have fun with you too.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:31.630
Aoi...

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:35.010
That's right. Rather than fearing failure,

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:38.810
it's more like you to go all out and overdo yourself a bit.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:39.930
Huh?

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:40.700
Aye!

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.810
That's the side of Ichigo-tan that Otome loves best.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:47.020
And there you have it. Go and give it everything you've got!

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.870
Hey! Don't you have a nicer way of...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.210
Sorry about that.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.080
But...

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:03.320
We believe in you. We know you can do it.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.540
Aoi...

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.500
Ran...

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.180
Ichigo-tan, fight! {fight on? fight-o?}

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:16.320
Otome-chan...

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:17.880
Yeah.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.940
<i>My usual self...</i>

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:32.450
Alright! I'll go out there with everything I've got!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.330
Yeah!

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.860
Hoshimiya-san, you're up soon.

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:13.670
Okay.

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:26.000
<i>I'd have never imagined that this would ever happen.</i>

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:32.840
<i>It wasn't too long ago that I was in the seats, 
looking up at Mizuki-chan as she shined brightly.</i>

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.690
<i>And now, I'm here.</i>

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.620
<i>About to stand alongside Mizuki-chan on stage.</i>

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.600
Two minutes until the next song.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.400
Someone bring some water!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.050
Mizuki-chan...

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:57.750
<i>I need to do my best.</i>

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:01.950
<i>I can't make Mizuki-chan have to cover for me!</i>

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:07.510
I'm fine now.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.420
Hoshimiya.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.420
Are you ready to shine?

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:15.880
Yes!

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:18.930
Here we go!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:25.430
<i>Will the one to overcome her 
wall be Hoshimiya? Or perhaps...</i>

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.190
<i>Today I get to match Mizuki-chan.</i>

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.800
Hey, who's that?

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:03.340
Dunno... I think I heard that there's a guest today...

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:04.530
Hoshimiya?

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.940
That's a pretty weak reaction.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.450
There are still a lot of people who don't know Ichigo yet.

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:13.420
Everyone, please love Ichigo-tan even more.

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:18.250
Today, I'll be introducing my cute underclassman to you all.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.090
This is Hoshimiya Ichigo-chan.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:22.970
N-Nice to meet you all.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.920
I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:30.920
I'm truly moved that I can be on stage today with Mizuki-san, whom I've always looked up to...

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:36.390
Oh! I've actually seen one of Mizuki-san's concerts here in this venue before.

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:39.640
I was so enamored with her that I couldn't sleep.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:42.990
It was after seeing her that I decided to become an idol...

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.570
Hoshimiya.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.320
Your intro's too long.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.570
Did I go on a bit too much?

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.850
She's actually pretty funny.

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.590
Yeah. Hoshimiya Ichigo-chan, right?

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:57.840
You'd better keep a good eye on her.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.920
Her popularity's about to skyrocket!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:29.990
A Cute Flash!

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.350
The Angel Arrow...

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.410
Next is the third one.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.450
She did it! She really did!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.040
Yeah, she did all three.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.430
She did it!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.570
Onee-chan's the best!

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:40.480
Yeah.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.160
Yeah!!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.000
It's Signalize!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.580
A Cool Flash!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.350
Hoshimiya...

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:09.400
She went too far.

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:18.160
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.140
<i>What happened...?</i>

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.170
<i>My energy's all gone...</i>

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.760
<i>My head's all fuzzy...</i>

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:29.770
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:32.970
<i>I need to do a Special Appeal with Mizuki-chan...</i>

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.350
This is it.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:09.470
<i>Incredible... Mizuki-chan really is awesome.</i>

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.790
<i>They'll be talking about Mizuki's performance for years to come.</i>

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.940
<i>I have to keep going until the very end!</i>

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.940
Unbelievable.

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.950
Is it... over?

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:43.850
I'm sorry!

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:46.330
Mizuki-san, I...

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:00.220
Is Otome dreaming?

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:04.660
The max number of Special Appeals is three... isn't it?

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.230
I've heard of them before.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:09.110
Fabled idols called Legends...

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:14.230
Those who can overcome the Special Appeal limit.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.240
Legends...

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:21.350
It looks like Onee-chan wasn't the only amazing one...

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.740
Mom?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.900
Incredible, it was a great success!

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:29.880
Yeah.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:35.860
Headmistress. Did you choose 
Hoshimiya expecting this to happen?

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:36.880
No way.

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:41.850
Looks like you've overcome another barrier, Mizuki.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:47.840
Hoshimiya.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.150
Thank you.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.120
Starmiya.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.410
Hey, Starmiya!

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:13.420
Oh, it's as if she can hear nothing.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.170
Oh well, let's begin.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.440
So you know, there's this new coord that I want...

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:53.230
I've never seen Ichigo so depressed.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:57.340
It's a lot to deal with, being shown 
just how far apart their skills are.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:05.850
Hey you.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:08.850
I can't clean with you there.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:11.480
Are you even listening to me, Hoshimiya?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.130
Man...

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:21.360
Oh yeah, so I heard you performed with Kanzaki Mizuki recently.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:24.390
That's pretty good for someone so new.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:27.490
Yeah, amazing.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.250
You're not supposed to agree.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:36.250
Yeah, Mizuki-san really is amazing!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:41.260
She's so great that I can't even 
begin to describe her amazingness!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.660
Awesome, awesome, awesome!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:46.010
She really <i>is</i> the best!

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.840
How many times are you going to say that?

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:51.590
I'm nowhere near good enough yet.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.520
I can't match Mizuki-chan's amazingness.

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:56.020
Her singing and dancing are both perfect.

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:58.520
She has the endurance to last an entire concert.

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:01.530
And her Special Appeals are the best!

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:05.020
I can't help but get excited every time I remember it.

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:08.580
And speaking of Mizuki-chan's Special Appeals—

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.620
Enough already, I know how great she is.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:14.130
I might not even be worthy to stand in her shadow yet...

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:19.340
I might not be able to catch up no matter how hard I work...

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:24.130
But one day I'll be like her.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:28.650
I'll be able to bring smiles and dreams to everyone...

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.120
And become a true idol!

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:39.150
I'm sure, even now, Mizuki-chan is moving on ahead of me.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.690
Here I go!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.610
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.150
She sure seems busy.

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:48.700
We have to cheer her up.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:52.230
That's all well and good, but what should we tell her?

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:56.360
I'm not sure, but we can't leave Ichigo the way she is now.

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:04.860
Aoi, Ran! Let's all do our best!

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:08.760
What just...?

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:10.970
Did she just cheer <i>us</i> up?

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:16.550
I'll aim to be a top idol just like Mizuki-chan! {mezase, bitches}

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:18.730
Aikatsu, Aikatsu!

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:20.730
Let's go!

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:57.830
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:01.460
Ichigo, your concert with Mizuki-chan was the best!

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:04.220
I went all out just like everyone said to!

00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:06.130
Yeah, you were perfect out there.

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:07.460
Thanks!

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:09.970
Don't fear failure!

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:12.800
February 14th is Valentine's Day!

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.510
Wonder who I should give chocolate to?

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:19.420
N-Neesan... p-please give me your chocolate!

00:24:19.420 --> 00:24:21.000
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:22.050
Chocolatlove.

00:24:22.050 --> 00:24:25.320
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
